<title>USA: Birmingham Steel sets recycling management.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Steel sets recycling management.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birmingham Steel Corp said Monday Jim C. Nuckels has been appointed chief operating officer of Pacific Coast Recycling LLC, the company's southern California joint venture with Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Nuckels has served Birmingham Steel in a variety of positions in administration and scrap procurement since joining the company in 1980, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
